ermId":"cloudwatch","name":"Amazon CloudWatch","shortName":"CloudWatch","category":"Monitoring","level":"beginner","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"CLF必須","oneLine":"AWSリソースのメトリクス、ログ、アラームを確認する監視サービス。"},{"termId":"cloudtrail","name":"AWS CloudTrail","shortName":"CloudTrail","category":"Monitoring","level":"beginner","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"CLF重要","oneLine":"AWSアカウント内で誰が何を操作したかを記録する監査ログサービス。"},{"termId":"api-gateway","name":"Amazon API Gateway","shortName":"API Gateway","category":"Integration","level":"intermediate","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"SAA重要","oneLine":"フロントエンドからLambdaなどを呼び出すAPIの入口を作るサービス。"},{"termId":"sqs","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service","shortName":"SQS","category":"Integration","level":"intermediate","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"SAA重要","oneLine":"処理をキューに入れて、システム間を疎結合にするメッセージキューサービス。"},{"termId":"sns","name":"Amazon Simple Notification Service","shortName":"SNS","category":"Integration","level":"beginner","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"CLF重要","oneLine":"メール、SMS、SQS、Lambdaなどへ通知を配信するPub/Subサービス。"},{"termId":"eventbridge","name":"Amazon EventBridge","shortName":"EventBridge","category":"Integration","level":"intermediate","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"SAA重要","oneLine":"イベント駆動アーキテクチャや定期実行を実現するイベントバスサービス。"},{"termId":"ebs","name":"Amazon Elastic Block Store","shortName":"EBS","category":"Storage","level":"beginner","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"CLF重要","oneLine":"EC2に接続して使うブロックストレージ。サーバーのディスクに近い役割を持つ。"},{"termId":"efs","name":"Amazon Elastic File System","shortName":"EFS","category":"Storage","level":"intermediate","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"SAA重要","oneLine":"複数のEC2などから共有できるフルマネージドなファイルストレージ。"},{"termId":"elb","name":"Elastic Load Balancing","shortName":"ELB","category":"Networking","level":"intermediate","examScopes":["CLF-C02","SAA-C03"],"priority":"SAA重要","oneLine":"複数のサーバーへアクセスを分散し、可用性を高めるロードバランサー。"},{"termId":"a